on\">\n                            One-click MCP server installation and OAuth support makes it easier to connect to third-party tools with authentication.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            April 15, 2026 · <span class=\"source-indicator\">cursor.sh</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://cursor.sh/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Background Agent for All Users</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Background Agent expanded from early preview to all users, enabling parallel task execution in remote environments via cloud icon.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            April 15, 2026 · <span class=\"source-indicator\">cursor.sh</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://cursor.sh/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Jupyter Notebooks Agent Support</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Agent can now implement changes directly in Jupyter Notebooks, creating and editing multiple cells (initially with Sonnet models).\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            April 15, 2026 · <span class=\"source-indicator\">cursor.sh</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n           