ard interface shows individual and team usage analytics, display name management, and detailed statistics by tool/model.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            April 15, 2026 · <span class=\"source-indicator\">cursor.sh</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot: Model Selection for Agents</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Improved model selection capabilities for Claude and Codex agents directly on github.com, giving users more control.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            April 14, 2026 · <span class=\"source-indicator\">github.com</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot: Data Residency and FedRAMP</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            New data residency options with US and EU storage locations, along with FedRAMP compliance for government customers.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            April 13, 2026 · <span class=\"source-indicator\">github.com</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://codeium.com/windsurf\" target=\"_blank\">Windsurf: MCP Integration</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            MCP integration allows users to enhance AI workflows by connecting to custom tools and services for extended capabilities.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            April 10, 2026 · <span class=\"source-indicator\">codeium.com</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://continue.dev\" target=\"_blank\">Continue: Continuous AI Code Quality Checks</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Source-controlled AI checks on every pull request, allowing teams to define standards as checks enforced by AI with human oversight.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            April 10, 2026 · <span class=\"source-indicator\">continue.dev</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/overview\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code: Terminal-Based Agentic Tool</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Terminal-based tool helps developers build features from descriptions, debug issues, navigate codebases, and automate tedious tasks.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            April 10, 2026 · <span class=\"source-indicator\">anthropic.com</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://devin.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Devin: Nubank Case Study</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Nubank achieved 8-12x efficiency gains and over 20x cost savings on a major ETL migration project using Devin's AI agents.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            April 10, 2026 · <span class=\"source-indicator\">devin.ai</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section (25%) -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights section\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    <h2>Technical Insights</h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"section-content\">\n                    <div class=\"stats-summary\">\n                        <strong>7 insights</strong> from industry experts\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://llm-stats.com/gpt-5-5-vs-claude-opus-4-7\" target=\"_blank\">GPT-5.5 vs Claude Opus 4.7</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Detailed comparison across benchmarks. Claude Opus 4.7 leads on 6 of 10 benchmarks while GPT-5.5 leads on 4. Covers pricing, latency, throughput.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-indicator\">llm-stats.com</span> · Jonathan Chavez · April 23, 2026\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">GPT-5.5</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Claude Opus 4.7</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">benchmarks</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                            <a href=\"https://llm-stats.com/gpt-5-5-vs-gpt-5-4\" target=\"_blank\">GPT-5.5 vs GPT-5.4</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            GPT-5.5 delivers 2× per-token price with identical latency, same 1M-token context, improvements on 9 of 10 benchmarks vs GPT-5.4.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-indicator\">llm-stats.com</span> · Jonathan Chavez · April 23, 2026\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">GPT-5.5</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">pricing</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">performance</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                      